    "collapsible_tabs_4RYYTC": {
      "type": "collapsible-tabs",
      "blocks": {
        "content_Cnf4MG": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "Do you send physical tickets or is it all e-tickets? ",
            "content": "<p>We do not send out physical tickets for our events. An email confirming registration will be sent to the booker who has purchased the ticket(s) and this email can be used as confirmation upon arrival at the event.  </p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "content_MyV3nb": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "I’ve purchased an event as a gift. Is there anything I need to do? ",
            "content": "<p>Please  <a href=\"/pages/corporate-private-events\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Corporate Private Events\">contact us </a>with the name and date of the tasting, along with the names, telephone number and email address of the recipient. This is so we can contact them directly with the details of the event. </p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "content_HJekM3": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "I’ve included a gift message. How will this be delivered? ",
            "content": "<p>If you’d like a gift letter to be sent out, please <a href=\"/pages/contact\" title=\"Contact\"> <strong>contact us</strong></a></p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "content_93zPem": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "Do I need to know lots about wine to attend? ",
            "content": "<p>Absolutely not! Our events target a range of experience and knowledge levels, and we try to make this clear on our event pages. If you’re unsure if an event is for you, simply contact <strong>events@kiwicru.com</strong> and we will try to help. </p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "content_RVBLc8": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "What is your cancellation policy? ",
            "content": "<p>Full details on our cancellation policy can be found <strong>here</strong>. (see below) </p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "content_kmadxJ": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "Can I join a waiting list for sold out events? ",
            "content": "<p>Yes. Please do feel free to join our waiting lists for sold out events. If tickets become available you will be contacted by email. </p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "content_j7wXRV": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "Cancellation Policy: Is there a charge if I cancel tasting tickets? ",
            "content": "<p>If you wish to cancel a ticket that you have purchased for a tasting or other event, please contact us as soon as possible. If you cancel your ticket at least 14 days before the date of the event a full refund will be arranged. If you cancel your ticket later than 14 days before the date of the event, we will seek to find another buyer for your ticket. If we are able to re-sell your ticket, a full refund will be arranged. If we are not able to re-sell your ticket, you will not be entitled to a refund (but you may still attend the event, if you change your mind) </p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "content_page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        }
